# Conventional Commit template
# Subject: type(scope): lowercase imperative summary (max 100 characters)
#
# Types: feat, fix, docs, test, refactor, perf, build, ci, chore, revert
# Use ! after type/scope for a breaking change.
#
# Explain WHY and relevant implementation details below. Wrap body lines
# at a readable width. Add issue references or BREAKING CHANGE footer if needed.
